{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_find.txt/0": "旅行者？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/140": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_不足\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/251": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/342": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/431": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/0": "你好，旅行者！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是当佣兵的，\r\n怎么样？要不要雇我？价格是$tmp3拉比斯左右，\r\n算贵吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/2": "不过，我会陪你走完\r\n整段旅程……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/3": "而且我还能飞，\r\n移动方面应该几乎不会受阻！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/4": "有护卫在会安心许多。\r\n而且似乎不受山、水地形影响。要请她当护卫吗？\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC  需要CHR等级2]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/5": "好……\r\n咦，你的钱不够啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/6": "先好好攒够\r\n$tmp3拉比斯，再来找我吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/7": "哎～怎么这样……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/8": "啊……抱歉。\r\n还是算了！\r\n我忽然有点不安……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/9": "魅力不足……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/10": "太好了！\r\n那么，接下来请多关照！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_486_ev_talk.txt/11": "\\c[51]天空人\\c[0]\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_48_seal_door_ev_talk.txt/2829": "使用封印之钥$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗数量\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_48_seal_door_ev_talk.txt/2895": "取消",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_damage.txt/0": "不妙……我要死了吗！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔……糟了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_damage.txt/2": "啧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_darkness.txt/0": "唔……怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_find.txt/0": "我们走散了……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/89": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/201": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/363": "赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/459": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/592": "赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/697": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/794": "“你没事吧？”",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/836": "没什么",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来现在不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "我没事。不过，\r\n谢谢你的关心！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "只是擦伤而已。\r\n不必担心！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "唔！\r\n情况渐渐不妙了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "情况不妙。但请放心。\r\n到死为止，我都会完成\r\n佣兵的使命！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "咔嚓咔嚓……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "“HP恢复了约一半！”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/8": "咕嘟咕嘟……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_490_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/9": "HP完全恢复了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_damage.txt/0": "呃……不妙……我要死了吗！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔……糟了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_damage.txt/2": "呜哇！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_darkness.txt/0": "唔……\r\n到这里就结束了吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_find.txt/0": "我们走散了……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/89": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/201": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/363": "赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/459": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/592": "赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/692": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/789": "“你没事吧？”",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/831": "没什么",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来现在不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "我没事。\r\n谢谢你的关心！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "我还撑得住。\r\n虽然受了伤，\r\n但没什么大碍。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "呃，伤口……\r\n再这样下去……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "咕哈，不妙。\r\n但我好歹也是佣兵！\r\n到死为止都会完成使命，请放心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "咔嚓咔嚓……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "“HP恢复了约一半！”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/8": "咕嘟咕嘟……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_491_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/9": "“HP完全恢复了！！”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_damage.txt/0": "哎哟……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔，糟了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_damage.txt/2": "好痛……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_darkness.txt/0": "怎么会！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_find.txt/0": "等等，等等——。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/199": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/310": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]_[浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/468": "赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/576": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/716": "赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/825": "\\c[4]赠送疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2个\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/924": "“你没事吧？”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/0": "几乎没受伤，\r\n看来不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/2": "你……是在担心我吗？\r\n我没事！不过……谢谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/3": "我还行，\r\n还能继续！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/4": "这……可能有点……不妙……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/5": "抱歉……我想我不行了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/6": "咔嚓咔嚓……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/7": "HP恢复了50%。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/8": "谢谢。我欠你一个人情。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/9": "咕嘟咕嘟……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/10": "HP完全恢复了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_492_ev_talk.txt/11": "谢谢！得救了！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_damage.txt/0": "唔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_darkness.txt/0": "不，怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_find.txt/0": "等……等等！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_talk.txt/0": "我想快点离开这里……\r\n想……回家。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_talk.txt/1": "终于……逃出来了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_talk.txt/2": "真的……\r\n真的非常感谢您。\r\n这是区区谢礼。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_talk.txt/3": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\\c[52]5000拉比斯\\c[0]与……\r\n\\c[52]净化誓约\\c[0]！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_493_ev_talk.txt/4": "真的太感谢了！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_495_knight_leader_ev_damage.txt/0": "唔、咕哇……！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_495_knight_leader_ev_damage.txt/1": "竟有这等本事……！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_495_knight_leader_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔…………嗯，\r\n果然……能做到。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_495_knight_leader_ev_dead.txt/1": "谢谢。\r\n这是……约定的东西！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_495_knight_leader_ev_dead.txt/2": "获得了骑士长之盾。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕嘎啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_find.txt/0": "站住！把钱留下滚蛋！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_find.txt/1": "哇呼——！\r\n这里有看起来很好欺负的家伙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_find.txt/2": "我今天也是为了家人在干活！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_talk.txt/0": "最近经济不景气，真难熬啊。\r\n再加上还有光之灾厄……\r\n各种事都凑到一块了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_496_desert_thief_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>仿佛在说“听我说嘛”，\r\n不停抱怨着\r\n世道……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕嘎啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_find.txt/0": "发现猎物！上啊——！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_find.txt/1": "呀哈哈！\r\n有个看起来很有钱的家伙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_find.txt/2": "让你见识一下\r\n<TARGET>的力量！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_talk.txt/0": "在沙漠里，要小心\r\n酷热和流沙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_497_desert_thief_leader_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>带着担忧的神情，\r\n正在讲述\r\n沙漠中的注意事项。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_damage.txt/0": "啊呀！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_dead.txt/0": "呀啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_find.txt/2": "没错……你杀害的那些动物的\r\n愤怒与痛苦……\r\n终于能得到报偿了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_find.txt/3": "我马上送你过去。\r\n到那个世界去后悔吧……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_talk.txt/0": "你该死。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是“森林防卫队”的\r\n总队长。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_talk.txt/2": "制裁盗猎保护动物之人，\r\n正是我们的职责。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_498_gf_commander_ev_talk.txt/3": "……你没有猎杀过吧。\r\n不会再有\r\n下一次机会了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_darkness.txt/0": "唔……Nami……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_talk.txt/0": "你打算怎么办？要让他加入吗？\r\n[当前CHR等级$tmp1] \\c[52][需要等级1]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_talk.txt/4683": "请跟我来。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_talk.txt/4749": "\\c[4]请跟我来。\\c[0]_(\\c[2]队伍已满\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_talk.txt/4823": "\\c[4]请跟我来。\\c[0]_(\\c[2]CHR不足\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_501_keyton_ev_talk.txt/4904": "再见……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_502_nami_ev_darkness.txt/0": "凯顿！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_502_nami_ev_talk.txt/0": "你打算怎么办？要让她加入吗？\r\n[当前CHR等级$tmp1] \\c[52][需要等级1]",
